## uncategorized todos

- coding.cmd.ask-reply: route timeout through task parameter so templates
  can assign individual timeouts matching task type (simple/json ~90s,
  multi-tool analysis ~777s+); extract :timeout:N: marker alongside :simple:

- job-assess security: :simple:/no_tools flag did not prevent tool use in one
  observed case — model wrote a markdown file to data/yaml/coding-tasks/ instead
  of returning JSON. maliciously crafted job listing could use this as prompt
  injection to write out-of-style modules or worse. investigate why no_tools
  was bypassed and add a path/namespace write guard for assessment tasks.
  later: allow note_read/note_write scoped to task group namespace so model
  can have basic cross-iteration memory without codebase filesystem access.
  forensics zenka reviews task-group note namespaces periodically — reads
  accumulated context against declared task logic to detect prompt injection
  artifacts, behavioral drift, or dark zones that develop silently over
  iterations. security model with no stake in the notes reads them cold.

- httpd: symlinked index.html causes Firefox to download raw symlink while
  curl -I shows correct Content-Type + Content-Length — investigate whether
  httpd follows symlinks differently for directory index vs explicit path,
  or if Content-Disposition is being set somewhere in the symlink path

